5807,4388,"ClickManager","base64",5342542,749,8266,1081,1191.,4487,6438.,6239,1448,795.,"s",1371736,6611,819.,900.,1084,2753,"Hops servers for Mondo Chick during minutes 0-15 of every hour (UTC clock), farms Mountain Top Field while staying 40 studs away from her until your bees kill her, then collects the loot for 60s and moves on. It has no Start button of its own: press Start on Vichop / Sprouts / Windy and Mondo takes over by itself in that window, then your mode continues.Walks under Windy to start the fight, then farms the loot in its field (following it to the next field) while your bees fight. Hops away from any Windy above the max level, and right after killing one at the max level.Goes to the King Beetle cave when it has respawned for you and walks Atlas's square around the cave, so the beetle never reaches you while your bees fight. Then picks up the loot and keeps hopping.MAIN: searches servers itself AND follows the alts: as soon as an alt reports a vic / sprout / Windy Bee it joins that server and does the kill.One message with kills, sprouts by rarity, loot and time per mode. Items count for this session (Reset session clears them).SOLO: works alone. To link accounts: same room key on all of them, Main on for ONE, Alt on for the rest, then Start.Before every hop NovaHop harvests planters that are ready, picks up the drops, replants, then keeps hopping.https://www.roblox.com/Thumbs/Asset.ashx?width=420&height=420&assetId=4744658743MAIN: set the room key so it can follow your alts. Without one it works alone.MAIN: Mondo hop is solo, the room is paused until the Mondo window ends.\nSearch settings (gifted, levels, sprout types, mode) follow your main. Checked before every hop, never during a fight. Tween movement only.https://games.roblox.com/v1/games/%d/servers/Public?sortOrder=Epic, Legendary, Supreme and Gummy sprouts are always farmed.Couldn't join (full / closed), trying the next serverNo vics, sprouts, Windy or Mondo this session yet.Dashboard: rel